OL,3,AKyiv air raid alerts at record high as
OL,4,ARussia launches round-the-clock strikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FKyiv is suffering more daily air raid
OL,7,Falerts than at any time since Russia's
OL,8,Ffull-scale invasion in 2022, according
OL,9,Fto BBC Verify analysis of government
OL,10,Ffigures.
OL,12,FMost air attacks used to come at night
OL,13,Fbut Russia's new tactic of striking
OL,14,FUkraine's capital during the day is
OL,15,Fcausing huge disruption to schools and
OL,16,Fbusinesses.
OL,18,FThe round the clock attacks have forced
OL,19,Fpeople to head for shelter as many as
OL,20,F13 times a day, with air raid alerts
OL,21,Flasting from a few minutes to nearly
OL,22,Ffour and a half hours.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
